		["debugHelp"] = "Click a line number to toggle a breakpoint. Start debugging from the debugger button beside Run, or choose the configured events. F5 continues, F10 steps over, F11 steps into script functions, Shift+F5 stops. The terminal can read and change locals at the paused line. Hover a variable in the editor to inspect it. New events wait in a bounded queue while WoW continues. Breakpoints are saved per script across reloads and follow their lines when text is inserted or removed. Markers on non-executable lines are retained but cannot pause execution; deleting a whole code line can remove its breakpoint.",
